	(text "+12V_KEY: switched +12 V from the bike harness (Br wire [TO VERIFY]).\nChain: 2 A fuse → reverse-polarity P-MOSFET → TVS → LC filter → 5 V buck.\nThe Pico is supplied through D103 with 470 µF of hold-up, to save the km when the key goes off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 17.78 0)
